minishell :)=> export b+=jkkkk
value --> [export] | type ---> 0
value --> [b+=jkkkk] | type ---> 0

{
        command[1] = [export],
        args = {
                [1] = [b+=jkkkk],
        }
}

export: `b+=jkkkk': not a valid identifier

